- Python: `make py-lint py-test`; `test_report_tokens_render.py` (implement golden); `test_report_tokens_scan.py`; `test_report_tokens_models.py` / `test_report_tokens_cost.py` unmodified.
- Repo: `bash scripts/relevant-checks.sh`; `make lint-bash32` after shell edits.
- Acceptance grep: no `--workflow`, `WORKFLOW_PATH`, or `workflow-path` under `skills/implement/` or in `implement-bootstrap.sh` / `persist-implement-run-flags.sh`; no `workflow-path` in `test-timing-ledger.sh`; `**Workflow path**` absent from new implement timing reports.

