- `/implement` never passes `--workflow` or persists `WORKFLOW_PATH`; Step 2 launcher timeout is always 7200s.
- Implement final summaries and timing reports show no Path / Workflow path lines; timing JSON `workflow_path` is `"unknown"`.
- report-tokens `--skill=implement` output matches revised golden (no workflow column/grouping).
- `/design` and report-tokens `--skill=design` behavior unchanged.

